## About

This repository holds the source code for **[kasimempire.com](https://kasimempire.com)**.

Kasim Elite Digital Global is a founder-led studio, not a big agency. Clients work directly with Kasim from the first message to the final handover. The studio designs and builds websites, fintech and crypto interfaces, brand identities, motion and AI video, and AI automation workflows for businesses worldwide.

## Pages

| Page | File | What it covers |
|---|---|---|
| Home | `index.html` | Introduction, services overview, promo video |
| About | `about.html` | Founder story, skills and journey |
| Services | `services.html` | Full service list with live mockups and real work samples |
| Portfolio | `portfolio.html` | Concept work and digital experiences |
| Store | `store.html` | Digital products: templates, guides and ebooks |
| Product | `how-to-make-money-with-ai.html` | Ebook page for *How to Make Money with AI* |
| Contact | `contact.html` | Contact form, WhatsApp and email |

